  "source_pdf": "downloads/ao-bings-little-boat-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "c025dd5b181bae909d822b4e5052ef0936231f9c9db751c5039139fab17b2bf9",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c8e08f39d93223c3002e7205f39ae889294e7e29a67f8b52fcd33d935e5822f7",
      "text": "敖丙的小船，\n浮起来！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b8a2b73efa8009ba273228c282b78d4ab9d156e9335ff146e2c1105dc3dfe2d4",
      "text": "悟空和敖丙捡到一片小叶子：\n“这片叶子想坐船！”\n沙僧往水盆里倒了些水。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d68c4d0a7dfc93ce95c9a7cb0928c8afa23bcbd850ac41637ca60e94af334f97",
      "text": "悟空搓了一个黏土球：\n“小叶子，这是你的船！”\n他把黏土球放进水里。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "74cc1a2ffa4f3dd6252a1e7f218c61032eab16e87dc6fb14307683a3ddbb708f",
      "text": "咚！\n黏土球一下子\n沉到了盆底。\n小叶子还在旁边等着。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7cff11ce9b9db63cbe9d52fe1967533b767221e75dfea5feacc886fd595a5ac6",
      "text": "“敖丙，龙的魔法能让它浮\n起来吗？”\n敖丙笑了：\n“我们用手试试看。”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "acfac490f8634e10c8619e6fc542d1a4fa6509e34b36df41fc1474ffc4785aa8",
      "text": "悟空把黏土捞出来。\n敖丙说：“还是这团黏土，\n我们来改变它的形状。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "963fe600708be9d35ce380b0c788dafcb98defab1de76536737d0de81e33dba3",
      "text": "他们把黏土压得又扁又宽。\n悟空说：“一张煎饼船！”\n“试一试！”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1f6e2795d3dba8970ac74eb439d8d80d27227be2e58b5d76673c4199db2383e0",
      "text": "扁扁的黏土也沉下去了，\n慢慢地、慢慢地。\n敖丙说：“嗯，\n它需要高高的边。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ed85aa0d5962c4402a769df36170cd70ef0c80c2645d26227774595a3b26b2bb",
      "text": "他们再改一次形状：\n把边捏高，\n一圈都捏起来。\n现在中间空空的。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fd7afbf75c6fff3064ed44b80d282602180e979d812f6091cec9f88f22d7eb28",
      "text": "他们再试一次——\n黏土小船浮起来了！\n悟空大喊：“浮起来啦！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ac9efcf8585dcd761fd2964ed003dd936a29e072326b1fb737f4278c55f6e2d8",
      "text": "敖丙说：“还是同一团黏土，\n只是换了一个形状。”\n沙僧笑着说：“试得好！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ab00e549a1c6400616a5aa80cf6be39d12d6e6ba57cb23f0e21876d865c8d46f",
      "text": "悟空把小叶子放进船里。\n高高的边挡住了水，\n小叶子稳稳地坐在船上！\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fac8e32fbf6bfcde816dbb592ebab3a079914ab7fc981b5aa429f09ccf066e94",
      "text": "悟空抬头看看桃树：\n“我要叫它‘大桃子号’！”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "31ee5a1c466847d87700eeecb09682518c399e3f7e7eadba4a887fec3dc5860b",
      "text": "敖丙哈哈大笑：\n“名字大一点没关系，\n可别真的装一只大桃子！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "136a7dd60468e4bebf8185b9b47559be6b68e563fd8f90705cf4ae43f6d1ad79",
      "text": "悟空轻轻一吹，\n呼——\n大桃子号漂到了水盆对面。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9542202c40b1fbe86ac9f8854f13f5274e0d4df71b1f65be6da1ba3985ea49d1",
      "text": "沙僧拿来一个真的桃子：\n“这个给我们吃，\n不给小船装！”\n小叶子继续坐船旅行。\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
